# Build output (generated by esbuild / build-vsix).
# dist/ and vsix/ are intentionally tracked: `npx <git url>` installs this repo
# as-is with no toolchain on the user's machine, so the CLI bundle and the
# packaged extension must ship in the tree. Rebuild with `npm run build:all`
# and commit the result whenever installer/ or Cursor++/ changes.
installer.zip

